      "writtenOn": "2020-02-26T01:40:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CL:380315 I think function name had simulate hence comment was not added.\n\nwe need to meet below case in button_interrupt() to succeed. \nif (next_deferred_time \u003c\u003d time_now ||\n    next_deferred_time \u003e state[i].debounce_time)",
      "parentUuid": "c2d1392a_72a97a5c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 318,
